 # UnderWeb X changelog
 
+## 0.6.14-rc40 — One Silk balance (casino ⇄ underweb.cloud)
+
+- **Casino balances on the site:** while you're in the hub casino, UWX reads the balances the casino writes to VRChat's log and passes them to underweb.cloud, so everyone's site balance, the leaderboard and the Hall of Whales stay current. One person running UWX in the instance covers everybody, Quest players included. A new **Share casino balances** switch turns it off.
+- **Silk from the site lands in the casino:** check-ins, events, streaks, photos and recruits now pay casino-sized Silk (+25,000 for a hub visit) that the casino adds to your balance next time you join.
+- The **Silk & hub check-ins** card shows your casino balance, Silk on its way, the richest players in the casino, and Silk from the site with its status.
+
 ## 0.6.13-rc32 — Professional polish
 
 - UWX opens in the dark theme by default. You can still pick light or system in Appearance.
